WEBVTT

00:11:28.086 --> 00:11:30.121
not the destruction --

00:11:30.145 --> 00:11:32.281
of our common home.

00:11:32.976 --> 00:11:36.778
It also implies a renewed politics,

00:11:36.802 --> 00:11:41.807
conceived as one
of the highest forms of charity.

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:44.903
Yes,

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:50.523
love is interpersonal,

00:11:50.547 --> 00:11:52.756
but love is also political.

00:11:54.883 --> 00:11:58.320
It involves all peoples
and it involves Nature.